TRANCE N DANCE (VOL.4) 🌌✨

From the collaboration of Pandora Music & Digital Dialogue comes Trance N Dance Vol.4 — a psychedelic journey where music, nature and the ocean come together. 🌴🌊

A beach gathering built around an amazing sound, deep frequencies, beautiful energy and a carefully curated lineup bringing you all night into another dimension.

