TRANSCENDENCE — VOL. 2 🐉🖤

When two worlds of underground sound collide, the dance floor becomes something else entirely.

Pandora × Digital Dialogue are taking the collaboration to the next level with TRANSCENDENCE — VOL. 2 — a night built for those who come to lose themselves in the music, the energy, and the collective frequency.

A carefully curated journey through psychedelic frequencies, deep grooves and hypnotic atmospheres, featuring a lineup we haven’t seen together on one dance floor in a very long time. ⚡️
This isn’t just another party.
It’s a descent into TRANSCENDENCE.

